 for any linear transformation $T,$ we have the following connection between the area of $D$ and the area of the image $T(D)$ under the action of $T:$\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(T(D))=|det(T)|\\cdot \\text{Area}(D).\n$$\n\nFrom the diagram, we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(D)=4\\cdot 2=8.\n$$\n\nComputing the determinant of $T,$ we get \n\n$$\ndet(T)=7\\cdot 3-(-2)\\cdot (-1)=19.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Area}(T(D)) & =|det(T)|\\cdot \\text{Area}(D) \\\\  & =|\\,19\\,|\\cdot 8 \\\\  & =152.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284039 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284040 13194139534357 true] [17592186284039 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284041 13194139534357 true] [17592186284039 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284042 13194139534357 true] [17592186284039 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284043 13194139534357 true] [17592186284039 1000 #edb/ref 17592186284044 13194139534357 true] [17592186284039 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534357 true] [17592186284039 1041 "selection" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284039 1104 #edb/ref 17592186284040 13194139534357 true] [17592186284039 1110 #uuid "732b52ff-670f-5504-a3fa-41c8362516b8" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284040 1034 "152" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284040 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534357 true] [17592186284040 1111 #uuid "25b69aad-6d9b-51d4-bcad-3a61d0dafdd2" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284041 1034 "121" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284041 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534357 true] [17592186284041 1111 #uuid "f8e4825e-4664-559b-ac26-bd9b920fa6db" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284042 1034 "320" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284042 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534357 true] [17592186284042 1111 #uuid "2145e9cd-9159-5c45-9da3-dc2b06db3c1f" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284043 1034 "-152" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284043 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534357 true] [17592186284043 1111 #uuid "183681bc-d490-50df-9982-d5abef86ec97" 13194139534357 true] [17592186284044 1034 "25" 13194139534357 true